00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,800
Using language Reading and listening

2
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,680
Animal extinction

3
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:13,920
Many animals have disappeared during a long history of the Earth.

4
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:16,600
The most famous of these animals are dinosaurs.

5
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:20,860
They lived on the earth tens of millions of years ago,

6
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:25,360
long before humans came into being and their future seemed secure at

7
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,040
that time.

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,960
There were many different kinds of dinosaur and a number of them used to live in China.

9
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:47,520
Not long ago a rare new species of bird-like dinosaur was discovered in Chaoyang County,

10
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:48,700
Liaoning Province.

11
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:52,200
When scientists inspected the bones,

12
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:57,180
they were surprised to find that these dinosaurs could not only run like the others

13
00:00:57,180 --> 00:00:59,460
but also climb trees.

14
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:02,960
They learned this from the way the bones were joined together.

15
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:08,740
Dinosaurs died out suddenly about 65 million years ago.

16
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Some scientists think it came after an unexpected incident

17
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,040
when a huge rock from space hit the earth and put too much dust into the air.

18
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:29,940
Nobody knows for sure why and how dinosaurs disappeared from the earth in such a short time.

19
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:33,460
We know many other wild plants,

20
00:01:34,020 --> 00:01:37,320
animals, insects and birds have died out more recently.

21
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:39,780
According to a UN report,

22
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:46,360
some 844 animals and plants have disappeared in the last 500 years.

23
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:49,540
The dodo is one of them.

24
00:01:49,820 --> 00:01:53,680
It lived on the Island of Mauritius and was a very friendly animal.

25
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:59,080
Please listen to a story of the dodo and how it disappeared from the earth.
